OL,3,GNEWSAFive children rescued off coast
OL,4,Aduring rising tide
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive children were rescued half a mile
OL,7,F(0.8km) offshore as the tide rose
OL,8,Faround them.
OL,10,FThey were reported at Shoebury Boom on
OL,11,FShoebury East Beach in Essex at 16:45
OL,12,FBST on Sunday.
OL,14,FSouthend-on-Sea RNLI launched its
OL,15,Fhovercraft and brought the cold but
OL,16,Funinjured children back to shore and
OL,17,Ftheir waiting parents.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
