OL,3,GNEWSAFive children rescued off coast
OL,4,Aduring rising tide
OL,5,
OL,6,F"They could have come into real danger
OL,7,Fquickly. With no way of calling for
OL,8,Fhelp, improper footwear and an
OL,9,Funfamiliarity with the area, today's
OL,10,Fcall could have had a very different
OL,11,Foutcome," warned RNLI volunteer
OL,12,FCommander Jonathan Charnock.
